      "kind": "figure",
      "alt": "Figure 5: grouped bar charts compare the control group in blue with Codelets in red. Mean completion time falls from about 22.2 minutes to 12.7 minutes; mean browser refresh count falls from about 19 to 9. Error bars show variation. Both reductions are statistically significant."
